# cursor-skills vault

New team skills go in the private skills vault at `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
Do not leave a shared skill only in `~/.cursor/skills/`.

Import with the engine's `scripts/import-skill.sh`, then run
`scripts/sync-vault.sh` and `scripts/install-skills.sh`.

If sync prints `remote is missing`, leave the commit local and say so.
